    "StartPoints": {"6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f01": 0, "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f35": 0, "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f36": 0, "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f98": 0},
    "localization": {"en": {
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f40": "I'm looking for something, and you can help me with this.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f41": "Interesting. Speak precisely. My time is valuable.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f42": "I'm looking for the TerraGroup case.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f43": "I need the case Prapor handed you.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f44": "And? You think I collect everything marked TerraGroup like that Ragman? You're mistaken.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f45": "The case I'm talking about was given to you by Prapor.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f46": "Next time, don't waste either your time or mine on pointless questions. Yes, I have the case. And this case is far too important to hand it over just like that.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f47": "Maybe we can make a deal?",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f48": "Seems like you're starting to understand something.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f49": "Fine. I'll trade the case for your work. You'll have to prove yourself. Agreed?",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f4a": "Like I have a choice.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f4b": "No one said you did.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f4c": "Listen carefully, I won't repeat twice: you need to find the blue folder documents in Tarkov. I don't want them freely available to anyone thinking they're smart enough to ask questions.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f4d": "Once you hand them to me, you'll get the next task.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f4e": "Now go.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f4f": "I have all the documents.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f80": "Leave",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f81": "This is not all of them. Return when you have the rest.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f82": "Good, you'll hand them over when you leave.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f83": "Now listen for your task at the Interchange, you'll have to draw attention. You know how. After that, you eliminate all those who come.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f84": "I'm here about the blue folder documents.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f85": "I'm here about the blue folder documents.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f86": "Interesting. I took that case for a reason. It is important.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f87": "All this has to be done in one time slot, without breaks.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f88": "Clear?",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f89": "Understood!",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f8b": "Then go. Time doesn't wait.",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f8c": "Leave",
      "6a8f4d5e90206485fa1d2f8d": "Accept the Interchange task."
    }}
  },
